%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &-7981033395474253806
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The slab.</b> A box 9.4 \xD7 7.6 m seen from below. Its underside (the soffit) is at 4.05 m and its top at 4.45 m. Around it, a fascia 12 cm thick that hangs down to 3.90 m."
--- !u!114 &-7753380200142670502
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The fixtures.</b> Six housings 1.30 \xD7 0.06 \xD7 0.24 m, each with two tubes (radius 2.2 cm, length 1.2 m) under it: four along the long sides at (\xB12.35, \xB13.1), two on the short sides at (\xB13.92, 0), turned 90\xB0. Name them <i>Fixture 1</i> to <i>Fixture 6</i> under <i>Canopy/Light Fixtures</i>. Their lights come in \xA7 9."
